{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53016","headline":"同李使君渭游等慈寺（题拟） · 崔公辅","name":"同李使君渭游等慈寺（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮阳清静理，永嘉山水心。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一五七《资州》）（〖1〗《舆地纪胜》云：「李渭爲本州刺史，有诗刻留等慈寺。\n时与前进士崔公辅同游，崔有诗略曰：『淮阳清静理，永嘉山水心。\n』」二句爲公辅颂渭之作。\n《全唐诗续补遗》卷十九据《蜀中名胜记》收作李渭诗，误。\n又《杜少陵集》卷十五有《赠崔十三评事公辅》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔公辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}